{"id":"004562375f0e2ba1","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-classifying-category.md","title":"简单多型演算的分类范畴","display":"df-classifying-category — 简单多型演算的分类范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-classifying-category","aliases":["16-df-classifying-category","Classifying category","16-classifying-category"],"display":"df-classifying-category — 简单多型演算的分类范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-algebraic-category]]","[[16-thm-algebraic-category]]"],"source":"Definition 2.1.1, pp.124–125 (PDF144–145); Definition 3.3.3, pp.185–186 (PDF205–206)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-classifying-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-classifying-category</span><span>Classifying category</span><span>16-classifying-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-classifying-category — 简单多型演算的分类范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4887bd10ad98ca45\" href=\"?note=4887bd10ad98ca45\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-category\">16-df-algebraic-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83dcad167d47dee4\" href=\"?note=83dcad167d47dee4\" title=\"16-thm-algebraic-category\">16-thm-algebraic-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 2.1.1, pp.124–125 (PDF144–145); Definition 3.3.3, pp.185–186 (PDF205–206)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4887bd10ad98ca45\" href=\"?note=4887bd10ad98ca45\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-category\">16-df-algebraic-category</a> 所采用的简单多型代数签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A)\">\\(\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A)\\)</span> 是该页已完整构造的带源靶标签六元组；范畴及有限积性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83dcad167d47dee4\" href=\"?note=83dcad167d47dee4\" title=\"16-thm-algebraic-category\">16-thm-algebraic-category</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C^{\\mathrm{simple}}_{\\Sigma,A}\">\\(\\mathbf C^{\\mathrm{simple}}_{\\Sigma,A}\\)</span> 为本页引入的分类范畴记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\)</span> 保持签名本身（无命题公理商）的既有记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C^{\\mathrm{simple}}_{\\Sigma,A}\\coloneqq\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A),\\qquad\n\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathbf C^{\\mathrm{simple}}_{\\Sigma,\\varnothing}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf C^{\\mathrm{simple}}_{\\Sigma,A}\\coloneqq\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A),\\qquad\n\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathbf C^{\\mathrm{simple}}_{\\Sigma,\\varnothing}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原稿仅用未构造的Context/Tm/判断相等名字描述一个一般演算，且只列Ob/Hom而未接到本书现有编码。现在复用本书内部已构造的语境、项列商、替换复合和有限积，明确区分无公理签名的分类范畴与模公理的分类范畴。单纯简单多型签名对应§2.1–§2.2，代数等式商对应§3.3。</p>\n<p>带指数的简单类型演算另有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"899007f1346b21cf\" href=\"?note=899007f1346b21cf\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntactic-category\">16-df-stlc-syntactic-category</a>；依赖语境另有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"42b5ac7685998854\" href=\"?note=42b5ac7685998854\" title=\"16-df-context-category\">16-df-context-category</a>。本页不把这三种不同的语法接口混成一个未经展开的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"4887bd10ad98ca45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"83dcad167d47dee4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-algebraic-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"4887bd10ad98ca45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 为 [[16-df-algebraic-category]] 所采用的简单多型代数签名，$A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma$。$\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A)$ 是该页已完整构造的带源靶标签六元组；范畴及有限积性质见 [[16-thm-algebraic-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"83dcad167d47dee4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 为 [[16-df-algebraic-category]] 所采用的简单多型代数签名，$A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma$。$\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A)$ 是该页已完整构造的带源靶标签六元组；范畴及有限积性质见 [[16-thm-algebraic-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntactic-category","status":"resolved","id":"899007f1346b21cf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"带指数的简单类型演算另有 [[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]；依赖语境另有 [[16-df-context-category]]。本页不把这三种不同的语法接口混成一个未经展开的 $\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-context-category","status":"resolved","id":"42b5ac7685998854","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"带指数的简单类型演算另有 [[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]；依赖语境另有 [[16-df-context-category]]。本页不把这三种不同的语法接口混成一个未经展开的 $\\Sigma$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C^{\\mathrm{simple}}_{\\Sigma,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C^{\\mathrm{simple}}_{\\Sigma,A}\\coloneqq\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A),\\qquad\n\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathbf C^{\\mathrm{simple}}_{\\Sigma,\\varnothing}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1768,"backlinks":[{"id":"e05113280ea5b50d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 是 [[16-df-classifying-category]] 采用的简单多型代数签名（不含命题公理商）"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-classifying-category|df-classifying-category — 简单多型演算的分类范畴]]"}],"outgoing":["4887bd10ad98ca45","83dcad167d47dee4","899007f1346b21cf","42b5ac7685998854"]}